":null,"peg":null,"grossMargins":0.26392,"summary":"NSB BPO Solutions Limited engages in the business of providing Business Process Outsourcing (BPO) services specializing support services solutions in India. The company provides a wide range of support services, such as customer care and customer help line call center for clients, Tele-sales, Tele collections, digitization of documents, processing of application and KYC forms, warehousing and archival, and payroll management. It also offers voice and non-voice support services, and Back Office Processing Services. Additionally, the company engages in trading activity of FMCG and staples goods including Pulses, Sugar, Rice, dry fruits, and fruits and vegetables. In addition, the company in involved in the inbound call center, outbound sales, back-office BPO, live chat and email, technical support / ITMS / FMS, analytics and reporting, IT managed. It serves telecom, banking, financial services, insurance, retail, quick commerce, travel and hospitality, state government, central govt., health care and pharma, and education industries. NSB BPO Solutions Limited was incorporated in 2005 and is based in Noida, India.","employees":1785,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795530087},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795530086,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"NSB BPO Solutions\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Concurrent Gainers: These 13 stocks gained for 5 days in a row, all rose over 27%","s":"The Economic Times","d":1795246152,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"NSB BPO Solutions passes all AGM resolutions including ₹150 crore borrowing cap","s":"scanx.trade","d":1790838000,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPang4YWpHbFl6bUlpYjE3Nl9faE4yUWFJeEUxRmFCV1MxRVNtWXdNRnF4Y2xpMC1xUHZNNlZoMnhIR0sxUHBURzdCYWpvZUl2V0FPaFRWUk9yc0h3WVB1aDdaRng0NzBSNEw2REZTeDh6bUZZT0dhdFd4a2RqUDQyMGI0aVJNeHN4